# Publish-time ignore rules for this workspace member.
#
# The repository root .pubignore excludes `packages/` so this package never
# ships inside the championforms archive. Pub applies ignore files from the git
# root down, so publishing from here must hide the enclosing repository:
#
#   GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES="$(cd .. && pwd)" dart pub publish --dry-run
#
# Pub then reads only the ignore files inside this package (this file plus any
# nested .gitignore such as example/.gitignore), so the build outputs normally
# covered by the root .gitignore are repeated here.
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
.DS_Store
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/
.vscode/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
build/
pubspec.lock
doc/api/
migrate_working_dir/
rust/target/

# Generated by local iOS builds of the example.
example/ios/Podfile.lock
